<fieldset><legend class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-900">כפתורי קישור (לא חובה)</legend><p class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-gray-500">עד 3 כפתורים שפותחים כתובת אינטרנט.</p><div class="mt-1.5 grid gap-1.5"><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-1.5"><input placeholder="טקסט הכפתור" aria-label="טקסט כפתור 1" class="rounded-md border border-gray-200 bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-sm focus:border-primary focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-primary" value="לאתר"><input dir="ltr" placeholder="https://" aria-label="כתובת כפתור 1" class="rounded-md border border-gray-200 bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-sm focus:border-primary focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-primary" value="https://example.test"></div><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap bg-transparent text-black hover:bg-gray-100/60 h-9 px-3 gap-3 text-[15px] justify-self-start"><div aria-hidden="true" class="dark:bg-white bg-black size-[15px] " style="mask-image: url(&quot;https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/plus.svg&quot;); -webkit-mask-image: url(&quot;https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/plus.svg&quot;); mask-repeat: no-repeat; -webkit-mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center; -webkit-mask-position: center; mask-size: contain; -webkit-mask-size: contain; mask-type: alpha;"></div><span>הוסף כפתור</span></button></div></fieldset><div><label for="sr-attachment" class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-900">קובץ מצורף לפי כתובת (לא חובה)</label><p class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-gray-500">כתובת https שפייסבוק יכול להוריד ממנה, למשל מחירון באתר שלך.</p><div class="mt-1.5 grid grid-cols-[1fr_auto] gap-1.5"><input id="sr-attachment" dir="ltr" placeholder="https://example.com/pricing.pdf" class="rounded-md border border-gray-200 bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-sm focus:border-primary focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-primary" value="https://example.test/price.pdf"><select aria-label="סוג הקובץ המצורף" class="rounded-md border border-gray-200 bg-white py-1.5 ps-2 pe-7 text-sm focus:border-primary focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-primary"><option value="file">קובץ</option><option value="image">תמונה</option><option value="video">סרטון</option><option value="audio">אודיו</option></select></div></div><div class="flex gap-2"><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap bg-solid text-white hover:bg-solid/85 h-10 px-4 gap-3"><span>שמור תשובה שמורה</span></button><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap bg-transparent text-black hover:bg-gray-100/60 h-10 px-4 gap-3"><span>ביטול</span></button></div></div></div></div>",
